<metadata preset-name="Eighties Chorus Clean" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="The lush early-80s chorus clean: a stomp compressor into a solid-state 2x12 with its built-in stereo chorus on (dry on one side, chorused on the other) and a single digital echo around 330 ms. Bright, wide and hard-edged; arpeggiate add9 and sus chords and let them shimmer." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
